OL,3,AHow a sex scandal at Nvidia is putting
OL,4,Apressure on the White House
OL,5,
OL,6,FHow close is Donald Trump to Jensen
OL,7,FHuang?
OL,9,FThe answer is very.
OL,11,FThe Nvidia boss was one of the few
OL,12,Fbusiness leaders with direct access to
OL,13,Fthe US president. He had met Trump
OL,14,Frepeatedly, travelled with him to
OL,15,FBritain and, in May, joined him on Air
OL,16,FForce One for his trip to China.
